        "original_id": "8383b343-a8b8-571b-9d5c-72cc6818f6d6",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: Saw II: Flesh & Blood, Saw 3D\n- People: Kevin Greutert, Patrick Melton, Marcus Dunstan, Tobin Bell, Costas Mandylor, Betsy Russell, Sean Patrick Flanery, Cary Elwes, Gabby West\n- Shows: Scream Queens\n\nFacts:\n- Saw II: Flesh & Blood was released in 2010 to coincide with the release of Saw 3D one week later.\n- Saw 3D, also known as Saw: The Final Chapter or Saw VII, is a 2010 American 3D horror film directed by Kevin Greutert and written by Patrick Melton and Marcus Dunstan.\n- Saw 3D stars Tobin Bell, Costas Mandylor, Betsy Russell, Sean Patrick Flanery, and Cary Elwes.\n- Gabby West won a role in Saw 3D through a competition on the reality show Scream Queens.",
